{"seq":2,"slug":"prompt-kv-batching","title":"Prompt、KV Cache 与动态批处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/ai-search-performance/generative-answers/prompt-kv-batching","wordCount":3493,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"prompt-kv-cache-与动态批处理\">Prompt、KV Cache 与动态批处理</h1><p>推理服务里有两个成本结构完全不同、却被放在同一张卡上争抢资源的阶段。<strong>Prefill</strong> 处理整个输入提示词，计算量随长度增长，是纯算力密集型——它需要把提示词的所有 token 一次前向过一遍模型权重，做的是大矩阵乘，GPU 的算力核心被吃满。<strong>Decode</strong> 每步只生成一个 token，但要读一遍全部模型权重，是<strong>显存带宽密集型</strong>——算力核心大部分时间在等数据。用一个比喻：prefill 像批量计算，decode 像逐个查询。同一张卡同时服务两种负载时，一个长 prefill 会把算力占满，同一批次里所有请求的 decode 都要等它——这不是配置问题，是架构问题，而理解它是这一篇的起点。</p>\n<p>在这一对矛盾之上，KV Cache 和动态批处理是推理服务的两个核心机制。KV Cache 让 decode 不必重算历史上下文，把每步的计算量从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；动态批处理让多个请求的 decode 共享同一遍权重读取，把显存带宽这个瓶颈摊薄。两者都在&quot;用资源换延迟或吞吐&quot;，本篇的目标是把这两个交换的数学形状讲清，从而知道参数该往哪调。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-kv-cache-与两阶段成本结构\">核心概念：KV Cache 与两阶段成本结构</h2><p>Transformer 的自注意力在生成第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 时，需要前面所有 token 的 Key 和 Value 向量来计算注意力。如果每生成一个 token 都重算一遍历史，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 步的成本是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，生成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 的总成本就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。KV Cache 的做法是把每一步算出的 K、V 存下来，下一步直接复用，于是每步只算新 token 的 K、V 和它与历史的注意力，单步降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（仍然要读全部历史的 K、V，但不用重算），总计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2) \\to O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 在计算量上的节省是巨大的——更准确地说，它避免了重复计算，代价变成了<strong>显存占用</strong>。</p>\n<p>KV Cache 的大小可以精确计算，这是容量规划里最该掌握的一个公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>KV bytes</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mtext>bytes per element</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{KV bytes} = 2 \\times L \\times H_{kv} \\times d_{head} \\times n_{tokens} \\times \\text{bytes per element}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KV bytes</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bytes per element</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 是 K 和 V 两份，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是层数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{kv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 KV 头数（在 GQA/MQA 架构下远小于注意力头数，这是现代模型省 KV 的主要设计），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{head}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每头维度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{tokens}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是已缓存的总 token 数。这条&quot;用更少的 KV 头省显存&quot;的路子有明确的文献出处：multi-query attention（MQA）把 key/value 在所有注意力头之间共享，只需&quot;一个 write-head&quot;，在增量解码上大幅降低内存带宽压力而质量损失很小（来源：Shazeer, <em>Fast Transformer Decoding: One Write-Head is All You Need</em>, arXiv:1911.02150, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1911.02150）；GQA\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1911.02150）；GQA</a> 则是 MQA 的推广，用&quot;多于一个、少于 query 头数&quot;的 KV 头数在质量（贴近多头）与速度（贴近 MQA）之间取中间点（来源：Ainslie et al., <em>GQA: Training Generalized Multi-Query Transformer Models from Multi-Head Checkpoints</em>, EMNLP 2023, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.13245）。\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.13245）。</a></p>\n<p>举一个数量级：一个 32 层、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{kv} = 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>128</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{head} = 128</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span></span></span></span></span>、FP16（2 字节）的模型，每 token 的 KV 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>128</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>131072</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 32 \\times 8 \\times 128 \\times 2 = 131072</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">131072</span></span></span></span></span> 字节 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>128</mn><mtext>KB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 128\\text{KB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KB</span></span></span></span></span></span>。这意味着一张 80GB 的卡减掉模型权重（比如 16GB）之后，大约能缓存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn><mtext>GB</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>128</mn><mtext>KB</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>52</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">64\\text{GB} / 128\\text{KB} \\approx 52</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GB</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/128</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">52</span></span></span></span></span> 万个 token。如果每个请求平均需要 4000 token 的上下文，那么<strong>同时只能有约 130 个请求在缓存里</strong>——这个数字直接就是并发上限，也是为什么要做批处理调度（把并发限制在显存能容纳的范围）而不是无限接纳。</p>\n<p>这个计算带来三个可操作的结论。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，上下文长度是并发能力的直接除数。</strong> 把提示词从 8000 token 砍到 3000 token，同一张卡能同时服务的请求数增加到 2.6 倍。所以&quot;缩短证据&quot;这个动作的收益不只是 prefill 变快，还包括<strong>并发能力提升</strong>——这是一个常被低估的二次收益。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，GQA/MQA 这类架构改动是省 KV 的根本手段。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{kv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从 32 降到 8 就是 4 倍容量，这比任何调度技巧都有效。选模型时，KV 成本应该和模型质量一起权衡——一个质量略低但 KV 开销小 4 倍的模型，在高并发场景下的总服务能力可能更强。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，KV Cache 的分页管理（paged attention）解决了碎片问题。</strong> 早期实现为每个请求预留一段连续显存（按最大长度预留），导致严重的内部碎片——实际用了 20%、剩下的 80% 浪费。分页方案把 KV Cache 切成固定大小的块（比如 16 个 token 一块），按需分配、用块表映射，把浪费压到接近零。这正是 vLLM 的 PagedAttention 所做的：受操作系统虚拟内存与分页技术启发，用固定大小的页管理动态变化的 KV cache，报告在同等延迟下相对 FasterTransformer 与 Orca 达到 2–4 倍的吞吐（来源：Kwon et al., <em>Efficient Memory Management for Large Language Model Serving with PagedAttention</em>, SOSP 2023, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.06180）——论文采用的分块大小即为每题块\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.06180）——论文采用的分块大小即为每题块</a> 16 token。这个改动通常能让同样的显存服务 2–4 倍的并发，是推理框架里性价比最高的工程优化之一。</p>\n<p><strong>前缀共享</strong>是 KV Cache 的另一个应用，它和 <a href=\"ttft-streaming\">首 token 延迟与流式渲染</a> 里讲的前缀缓存是同一机制的两个正面：从并发角度看，它让多个请求共享同一段前缀的 KV 块（无需复制），从延迟角度看，它让新请求跳过这段 prefill。两个收益都来自&quot;多个请求有相同的前缀&quot;这个事实，所以<strong>提示词前缀的稳定化设计是同时买到两个收益的一处改动</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态批处理-吞吐与延迟之间的那个旋钮\">动态批处理：吞吐与延迟之间的那个旋钮</h2><p>批处理的基本逻辑：GPU 在 decode 阶段大部分时间在等显存读权重，所以让多个请求一起过一遍权重（同一批内每个请求算各自的 token），可以把权重读取成本摊到多个请求上。批大小从 1 增到 16，吞吐几乎线性增长；从 16 到 64，增长开始放缓；超过某个点后，吞吐不再增长（瓶颈转移到算力或显存带宽本身）。这个曲线形状是所有推理服务调优的基础。</p>\n<p>三个显存与吞吐量级的对照，可以说明 KV Cache 与批大小如何共同决定一台机器的服务能力（按上一节的每 token 128KB KV 估算，80GB 卡、16GB 权重）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>提示词长度</th>\n<th>单请求 KV 占用</th>\n<th>可同时驻留的请求数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1,000 token</td>\n<td>~128MB</td>\n<td>~500</td>\n<td>短上下文，并发受算力限制而非显存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4,000 token</td>\n<td>~512MB</td>\n<td>~128</td>\n<td>典型证据量级，显存与算力大致平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16,000 token</td>\n<td>~2GB</td>\n<td>~32</td>\n<td>长证据，显存成为硬约束，P99 对批大小极敏感</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表解释了为什么&quot;砍证据长度&quot;的收益会翻倍：它同时降低单请求 KV 占用（提升并发）、降低 prefill 时间（提升 TTFT）、并降低批内最长请求对整批的拖累（改善 P99 抖动）。</p>\n<p>代价在延迟侧，而且形状不同。<strong>批处理对吞吐的收益递减，对延迟的代价递增。</strong> 原因是：</p>\n<p><strong>静态批处理</strong>要求一批凑齐才开始，如果凑不齐就等——等待时间直接加到 TTFT 上。所以静态批的批大小越大，平均等待越长。</p>\n<p><strong>动态批处理（continuous batching）</strong> 解决了这个问题：不等一批结束，每生成一个 token 就重新组批，已完成的请求退出、新请求加入。这让 GPU 始终处于高利用率，且新请求不必等整批结束。这是当前所有主流推理框架的标准做法（概念上由 Orca 等系统提出，vLLM、TensorRT-LLM 等都实现了各自的变体）。Orca 在 OSDI 2022 上把这一机制称为 <strong>iteration-level scheduling</strong>：调度器每次只跑一个模型迭代，而不是为整个请求固定一个批次，从而让已完成的请求更早返回、新到达的请求更早加入（来源：Yu et al., <em>Orca: A Distributed Serving System for Transformer-Based Generative Models</em>, OSDI 2022, <a href=\"https://www.usenix.org/conference/osdi22/presentation/yu）。\">https://www.usenix.org/conference/osdi22/presentation/yu）。</a></p>\n<p>动态批处理下的延迟模型更微妙。单个请求的 decode 延迟约等于&quot;它所在批次的单步耗时 × 它需要的 token 数&quot;，而单步耗时随批大小增长（虽然次线性）。所以：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>decode</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>step</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>step</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{decode}} \\approx n_{\\text{out}} \\times t_{\\text{step}}(B), \\quad t_{\\text{step}}(B) = a + b \\cdot B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decode</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 是批大小。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 从 8 提到 32，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>step</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{step}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可能涨 1.5 倍，但吞吐涨 3 倍——这就是为什么高吞吐场景愿意接受更长的单请求延迟。<strong>关键在于这个交易是否被业务接受，而不是哪个数字更漂亮</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R[请求到达] --&gt; Q[等待队列]&#10;    Q --&gt; B{调度器: 每步重组批}&#10;    B --&gt; M[批内混入 prefill 与 decode 请求]&#10;    M --&gt; K{是否启用 chunked prefill?}&#10;    K --&gt;|否| L[长 prefill 阻塞整批 decode&lt;br/&gt;→ 其他请求 P99 尖刺]&#10;    K --&gt;|是| S[长 prefill 切成小块&lt;br/&gt;每步只处理一部分]&#10;    S --&gt; O[decode 请求每步都能推进&lt;br/&gt;P99 抖动显著降低]&#10;    L --&gt; O2[单步完成, 输出 token]&#10;    O --&gt; O2&#10;    O2 --&gt; D[KV Cache 按块分配]&#10;    D --&gt; E{显存是否接近上限?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| P[抢占低优先级请求&lt;br/&gt;或拒绝新请求]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| B&#10;    P --&gt; B\">graph TD\n    R[请求到达] --&gt; Q[等待队列]\n    Q --&gt; B{调度器: 每步重组批}\n    B --&gt; M[批内混入 prefill 与 decode 请求]\n    M --&gt; K{是否启用 chunked prefill?}\n    K --&gt;|否| L[长 prefill 阻塞整批 decode&lt;br/&gt;→ 其他请求 P99 尖刺]\n    K --&gt;|是| S[长 prefill 切成小块&lt;br/&gt;每步只处理一部分]\n    S --&gt; O[decode 请求每步都能推进&lt;br/&gt;P99 抖动显著降低]\n    L --&gt; O2[单步完成, 输出 token]\n    O --&gt; O2\n    O2 --&gt; D[KV Cache 按块分配]\n    D --&gt; E{显存是否接近上限?}\n    E --&gt;|是| P[抢占低优先级请求&lt;br/&gt;或拒绝新请求]\n    E --&gt;|否| B\n    P --&gt; B</pre><h2 id=\"chunked-prefill-解决-p99-尖刺的关键一招\">chunked prefill：解决 P99 尖刺的关键一招</h2><p>上图的右边分支值得单独展开，因为它是<strong>TTFT/TPOT 尾部延迟</strong>的主要来源。</p>\n<p>如果不做处理，调度器会把一个长 prefill（比如 8000 token 的提示词）和一批 decode 请求放在同一步里。这一步会非常慢（prefill 计算量大），导致批内所有 decode 请求都停顿一下——用户看到的是&quot;逐字输出卡了一下&quot;。这个现象在 P99 上非常明显：P50 的卡顿可能察觉不到，P99 会出现数百毫秒的停顿。</p>\n<p><strong>Chunked prefill</strong> 的做法是把长提示词切成若干块（比如每块 512 token），每步只处理其中一块，与 decode 请求混在同一个批次里。这样每一步的耗时被控制在一个上限内（算力预算在每个时间片内分摊），decode 请求的每步延迟变得平滑。这一机制有专门的系统论文：Sarathi-Serve 提出 <strong>chunked-prefills</strong>，把 prefill 请求切成尺寸相近的块，构造出&quot;无停顿（stall-free）&quot;的调度，从而在不打断已在运行的 decode 的前提下加入新请求、用更大的批换取吞吐，同时限制其对延迟的影响（来源：Agrawal et al., <em>Taming Throughput-Latency Tradeoff in LLM Inference with Sarathi-Serve</em>, OSDI 2024, <a href=\"https://www.usenix.org/conference/osdi24/presentation/agrawal）。代价是那个长请求的\">https://www.usenix.org/conference/osdi24/presentation/agrawal）。代价是那个长请求的</a> prefill 总时长变长（因为它要和别人分享每个时间片），也就是它的 TTFT 变差——<strong>这是拿长请求的 TTFT 换所有请求的 P99 平滑</strong>，对交互式搜索几乎总是划算的，因为用户对&quot;逐字输出卡顿&quot;比对&quot;多等 200ms 才开始&quot;更敏感。</p>\n<p>这场交易可以通过一个参数直接调节：<strong>每步分配多少算力给 prefill</strong>（或等价地，prefill chunk 的大小）。这个参数调小 → decode 更平滑、长 prefill 的 TTFT 更差；调大 → 反之。它是 AI 搜索服务最该精细调的一个参数，因为搜索的请求形态两极分化：改写这类短请求 prefill 只有几十 token，而答案生成可能读入几千 token 的证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优先级-搜索场景必须做的事\">优先级：搜索场景必须做的事</h2><p>搜索流量天然分层，把不同优先级的请求放进同一个批队列是浪费。</p>\n<p><strong>交互式请求</strong>（用户正在等待的答案生成）必须优先，它们的延迟是用户可感知的。<strong>预取请求</strong>（猜测用户下一个查询，见 <a href=\"../hybrid-retrieval/query-planning\">AI 搜索的查询规划与改写</a>）是可丢弃的，负载高时应该第一个被牺牲。<strong>离线批处理</strong>（重算 embedding、离线评测、重建索引）应该走独立队列甚至独立实例，绝不能与线上请求共享 GPU——这是最常见的一种自伤。</p>\n<p>实现上，优先级队列需要配合<strong>抢占</strong>才有效：高优先级请求到达时，如果 GPU 已被低优先级请求占满，调度器应该能暂停低优先级请求、让出 KV Cache 块、服务高优先级请求，之后再恢复。这要求 KV Cache 支持换出（offload 到 CPU 内存）或丢弃后重算——前者省算力但吃 CPU 内存带宽，后者简单但浪费算力。选择取决于抢占发生的频率：偶发抢占用重算更简单，高频抢占必须换出。</p>\n<p>最后要强调一条纪律：<strong>优先级机制必须有硬上限和公平性护栏</strong>。一个被无限推迟的低优先级请求，在工程上等价于丢失；如果预取请求永远排不上队，那不如直接关掉预取。所以要有&quot;最长等待时间&quot;的兜底：超过它要么提升优先级要么明确拒绝，不能让它悬着。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Prefill 是算力密集、decode 是显存带宽密集，两者同卡争抢是架构性问题；分离部署或 chunked prefill 是两种应对。</li>\n<li>KV Cache 让 decode 从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，代价是显存；其大小可用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>tokens</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mtext>bytes</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times L \\times H_{kv} \\times d_{head} \\times n_{\\text{tokens}} \\times \\text{bytes}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tokens</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bytes</span></span></span></span></span></span> 精确估算，这个数字直接决定并发上限。</li>\n<li>缩短提示词有二次收益：既省 prefill 时间，又成比例提升可并发的请求数；选模型时 KV 开销应与质量一起权衡（GQA 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{kv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 缩减等效于数倍容量）。</li>\n<li>批处理对吞吐的收益递减、对延迟的代价递增；动态批处理消除&quot;凑批等待&quot;，chunked prefill 用长请求的 TTFT 换全部请求的 P99 平滑。</li>\n<li>搜索流量必须分层：交互式优先、预取可丢弃、离线走独立实例；优先级机制需要抢占能力与最长等待兜底，否则等价于丢失。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Prompt、KV Cache 与动态批处理","id":"prompt-kv-cache-与动态批处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：KV Cache 与两阶段成本结构","id":"核心概念-kv-cache-与两阶段成本结构"},{"level":2,"text":"动态批处理：吞吐与延迟之间的那个旋钮","id":"动态批处理-吞吐与延迟之间的那个旋钮"},{"level":2,"text":"chunked prefill：解决 P99 尖刺的关键一招","id":"chunked-prefill-解决-p99-尖刺的关键一招"},{"level":2,"text":"优先级：搜索场景必须做的事","id":"优先级-搜索场景必须做的事"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"首 token 延迟与流式渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/ai-search-performance/generative-answers/ttft-streaming"},"next":{"title":"质量、速度、成本三角与答案降级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/ai-search-performance/generative-answers/quality-speed-cost"}}